  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/11/IMG_0178.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(7 fotos) New Robinson, en la calle San Bernardo, 17 de Onda ha ampliado y renovado esta semana su equipo. Se incorpora Gina Valentina y Paula Bell&eacute;s Claras (con jersey blanco) sustituye como encargada a Gabriela Rizea, aunque &eacute;sta sigue gestionando el local, pero en un segundo plano.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouequipnewrobinson/img_0178.jpg\" alt=\"img_0178\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouequipnewrobinson/img_0181.jpg\" alt=\"img_0181\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouequipnewrobinson/img_0183.jpg\" alt=\"img_0183\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouequipnewrobinson/img_0186.jpg\" alt=\"img_0186\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouequipnewrobinson/img_0187.jpg\" alt=\"img_0187\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouequipnewrobinson/img_0191.jpg\" alt=\"img_0191\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouequipnewrobinson/img_0196.jpg\" alt=\"img_0196\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
